{"2548670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Luminis: Heal Them All", "steam_appid": 2548670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Wildlife and machines alike have turned hostile, twisted by a spreading infection rather than malice. Instead of fighting back with force, you carry weapons built to cure. Calm the infected, restore their will, and turn former enemies into companions who fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Heal the Sick</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mutating virus is wreaking havoc on wildlife. Meanwhile, a rogue faction has hacked robots across the region, unleashing chaos to further their own agenda.<br>As a volunteer healer, you’ve left your old life behind to explore, survive, and cure whatever you can.<br>You’re humanity’s best hope, and their first gentle hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/e4496019af40f4ce317898be8a201d78.poster.avif?t=1787661785\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/e4496019af40f4ce317898be8a201d78.webm?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/e4496019af40f4ce317898be8a201d78.mp4?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Combat</strong> <strong>with a twist</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you shoot things, but not to kill.  <br>You’ll wield therapeutic rifles, pistols, shotguns, and snipers, all designed to calm and cure. <br>Heal, and enemies will stop attacking and become your best allies who help you heal other infected.  <br>Combat is tense, tactical, and driven by compassion, not violence.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/73a354c384bc9086aba3e0dd45d429b0.poster.avif?t=1787661785\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/73a354c384bc9086aba3e0dd45d429b0.webm?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/73a354c384bc9086aba3e0dd45d429b0.mp4?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the open world for loot and lost tech.<br>From food and crafting materials to powerful healing gear, survival depends on how well you adapt.<br>The wild can be harsh, but every life you save makes it better.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.poster.avif?t=1787661785\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.webm?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.mp4?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The demo is designed as a prologue — 1–2 hours of high-quality gameplay built like a full chapter of the game. It includes the same environments, assets, and animations as the full experience to showcase the true vision of Luminis.)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Wildlife and machines alike have turned hostile, twisted by a spreading infection rather than malice. Instead of fighting back with force, you carry weapons built to cure. Calm the infected, restore their will, and turn former enemies into companions who fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Heal the Sick</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mutating virus is wreaking havoc on wildlife. Meanwhile, a rogue faction has hacked robots across the region, unleashing chaos to further their own agenda.<br>As a volunteer healer, you’ve left your old life behind to explore, survive, and cure whatever you can.<br>You’re humanity’s best hope, and their first gentle hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/e4496019af40f4ce317898be8a201d78.poster.avif?t=1787661785\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/e4496019af40f4ce317898be8a201d78.webm?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/e4496019af40f4ce317898be8a201d78.mp4?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Combat</strong> <strong>with a twist</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you shoot things, but not to kill.  <br>You’ll wield therapeutic rifles, pistols, shotguns, and snipers, all designed to calm and cure. <br>Heal, and enemies will stop attacking and become your best allies who help you heal other infected.  <br>Combat is tense, tactical, and driven by compassion, not violence.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/73a354c384bc9086aba3e0dd45d429b0.poster.avif?t=1787661785\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/73a354c384bc9086aba3e0dd45d429b0.webm?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/73a354c384bc9086aba3e0dd45d429b0.mp4?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Explore</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the open world for loot and lost tech.<br>From food and crafting materials to powerful healing gear, survival depends on how well you adapt.<br>The wild can be harsh, but every life you save makes it better.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.poster.avif?t=1787661785\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.webm?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/extras/361a3b448e3ddaac5592cead53c357e8.mp4?t=1787661785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The demo is designed as a prologue — 1–2 hours of high-quality gameplay built like a full chapter of the game. It includes the same environments, assets, and animations as the full experience to showcase the true vision of Luminis.)</p>", "short_description": "Every shot heals. In this story-driven shooter created primarily by 1 developer, you set out to save those in need. Heal enemies into allies with therapeutic firepower. Restore the world from sickness to health.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/a6d3108123ac6795efe17b6d594a81b7ba8d41d9/header.jpg?t=1787661785", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/ff05ffb24bae0ca665fd5ac5c983f07145e4611a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787661785", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548670/ff05ffb24bae0ca665fd5ac5c983f07145e4611a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787661785", "website": "https://www.miraclestudio.games/Luminis", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 580 or NVIDIA GeForce RTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum disk space is for demo, which is around 15 GB.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong